---
title: Americano
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, aperitivo]
source: Classic cocktail, number 15 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Fill a #highball glass{} with ice. Pour in @Campari{1%fl_oz} and @sweet vermouth{1%fl_oz}, top with @club soda{3%fl_oz}, and stir once. Garnish with an @orange{1%slice}.
